│ duration of each treatment was 3 weeks, for a total of 12 weeks. Outcome measures included the functional score and  │
│ shoulder kinematics.                             Results           Overall, subjects in both groups improved over    │
│ the 12 weeks. Statistically significant improvements were found in ERM and MWM. Additionally, MWM corrected          │
│ scapulohumeral rhythm significantly better than ERM did.                             Discussion and Conclusion       │
